(6793413, 1019810, 138630, '<td valign="top">My favorite and top score of the challenge.  Love the concept and the colors.  Wish there was a bit less blur in the lower left but I''m assuming lens baby?  Voted earlier.</td>', 'My favorite and top score of the challenge.  Love the concept and the colors.  Wish there was a bit less blur in the lower left but I''m assuming lens baby?  Voted earlier.', '2012-06-12 23:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793414, 1019247, 138630, '<td valign="top">Made me smile, great textures, lots of story possibilities here.  I like the crazy tilt and funny angles.  Not sure about the pink cast around the elbow.  An excellent score from me.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Made me smile, great textures, lots of story possibilities here.  I like the crazy tilt and funny angles.  Not sure about the pink cast around the elbow.  An excellent score from me.  Voted earlier.', '2012-06-12 23:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793415, 1019092, 138630, '<td valign="top">Lots of graveyards and markers in the challenge - a very appropriate subject - but this was my favorite.  Besides that the marker itself is simple but interesting and well placed in the frame, the light and tones are lovely -- almost too pretty for the title.  A 9 from me.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Lots of graveyards and markers in the challenge - a very appropriate subject - but this was my favorite.  Besides that the marker itself is simple but interesting and well placed in the frame, the light and tones are lovely -- almost too pretty for the title.  A 9 from me.  Voted earlier.', '2012-06-12 23:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
