(6793975, 1019811, 77196, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the blue! I agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=66384" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">JuliBoc</a>''s comment. Wonderful lines, light, and texture. In addition, there are zero distractions from the leading lines. I think the arch above the sealed opening gives just that extra twist to make it a tad unusual and adds a lot of interest. What''s behind the "door"? I want to know! Well seen.<br/></td>', 'Congratulations on the blue! I agree with  JuliBoc''s comment. Wonderful lines, light, and texture. In addition, there are zero distractions from the leading lines. I think the arch above the sealed opening gives just that extra twist to make it a tad unusual and adds a lot of interest. What''s behind the "door"? I want to know! Well seen.', '2012-06-13 09:45:28.000000', NULL, 0),
