(6794473, 1018933, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''ll give you some feedback.  I did not vote this high.  I did get the "dead end" bit, but thought the picture was much more on the "documentary" side than the "artistic" side.  The tree jutting in on the left; the tree at the top; the shadows acros the bears face; the stripe of shadow across the bottom; the fact he''s not looking at the camera, all things you are obviously not thinking about when you are just trying to capture a picture of a wild bear, but still detrimental to the photo nonetheless.</td>', 'I''ll give you some feedback.  I did not vote this high.  I did get the "dead end" bit, but thought the picture was much more on the "documentary" side than the "artistic" side.  The tree jutting in on the left; the tree at the top; the shadows acros the bears face; the stripe of shadow across the bottom; the fact he''s not looking at the camera, all things you are obviously not thinking about when you are just trying to capture a picture of a wild bear, but still detrimental to the photo nonetheless.', '2012-06-13 16:43:37.000000', NULL, 0),
