(6795307, 1019495, 96721, '<td valign="top">It''s crap... LOL no in all seriousness:<br/> <br/>I like this image, it fits the challenge well and I do like the desat. For me it could have been improved by cropping an inch off the left of the image as this "opens" it up nicely and to my eye emphasises even more the "Track to Nowhere" as it brings to life the left hand track which has the subconsious effect of taking my eye then to the deadend track.<br/> <br/>Hope this is of some use.<br/> <br/>ETA: Congrats on Top Ten :)<br/> <br/>ETA #2: The crap comment was based on your forum post and was just a joke :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-06-14 15:31:26.</i></td>', 'It''s crap... LOL no in all seriousness: I like this image, it fits the challenge well and I do like the desat. For me it could have been improved by cropping an inch off the left of the image as this "opens" it up nicely and to my eye emphasises even more the "Track to Nowhere" as it brings to life the left hand track which has the subconsious effect of taking my eye then to the deadend track. Hope this is of some use. ETA: Congrats on Top Ten :) ETA #2: The crap comment was based on your forum post and was just a joke :)', '2012-06-14 16:22:18.000000', '2012-06-14 16:31:26.000000', 0),
