(6795748, 1019543, 64446, '<td valign="top">I think the reason this image went underrated is that it only works with the title, it does not convey a "dead end" per se, without that comment/description.<br/>I like the story, though. Plus, the composition and technique are right on: sharp focus on the boy, a lovely DOF, saturation and square crop with subject slightly off-centered.<br/>Well done!!!</td>', 'I think the reason this image went underrated is that it only works with the title, it does not convey a "dead end" per se, without that comment/description.I like the story, though. Plus, the composition and technique are right on: sharp focus on the boy, a lovely DOF, saturation and square crop with subject slightly off-centered.Well done!!!', '2012-06-15 01:07:50.000000', NULL, 0),
